    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d243">

                <pb facs="0564" n="538" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v10/pg538"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">888.2553/11–2652</note>
                <head>No. 243<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Acting Secretary of State to the President</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, [<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" notAfter="1952-12-03T23:59:59-05:00"
                            notBefore="1952-11-26T00:00:00-05:00">undated</date>].</dateline>
                </opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>Subject:</label>
                    <item>Iranian Oil Problem</item>
                </list>
                <p>Attached is a suggested letter which you may wish to send to the Department of
                    State. This letter is designed to carry out the decisions which you made on
                    November 7 in endorsing a memorandum in respect of the decisions necessary to
                    move forward towards a solution of the Iranian dispute.</p>
                <p>Since last I talked with you on this subject, we have had further conversations
                    with the British which make it appear probable that <pb facs="0565" n="539"
                        xml:id="pg539"/> the participation of our major oil companies will be
                    necessary if we are to achieve a solution of the Iranian oil problem.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">David
                                Bruce</hi></signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d243-a1.xml" xpointer="d243-a1"/>
            </div>
